  - quantum foundations
  - pre-registered analysis
  - hidden-variable models
abstract: >-
  Pre-registered search for a dependence of the joint statistics of one
  wing's outcome and an environment witness on the remote wing's setting
  (L_exp) in public loophole-free Bell-test data. Quantum mechanics fixes
  L_exp at exactly zero. Result: clean null across 12 pre-registered tests
  on the Delft 2015/2016 event-ready datasets; pooled bound L_exp <~ 0.105
  (95%) in the recorded heralding channel. Includes exact reproductions of
  the published S values of Delft 2015/2016 and ETH 2023, and a one-command
  reproduction harness.
